// part: Steps
// title: A recipe
// ask: How do I make masala chai?
<Card title="Masala chai" subtitle="2 cups · 10 minutes">
  <Steps>
    <Step title="Boil the spices">1 cup water, 2 crushed cardamom, a slice of ginger. 2 minutes.</Step>
    <Step title="Add the tea">2 teaspoons of black tea. Let it bubble for 1 minute.</Step>
    <Step title="Add milk and sugar">1 cup milk, sugar to taste. Bring it up to a boil twice.</Step>
    <Step title="Strain and serve">Pour through a sieve into cups.</Step>
  </Steps>
</Card>
